WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:26.614
A ship laden with sorrows

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:38.794
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:48.134
From the blackest depths

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:54.674
It rises to the surface

00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:09.794
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:21.544
Flying off into the vast sky

00:01:21.544 --> 00:01:35.724
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:46.794
What's going on, Michi!
If you don't hurry we'll be late!

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:48.664
Michi!

00:01:50.544 --> 00:01:52.334
Still not dressed?!

00:01:53.444 --> 00:01:55.934
Honestly, what are you thinking?!

00:01:58.544 --> 00:01:59.914
Oh!

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:22.234
She's working hard on that script...

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:23.994
Hmm?

00:02:25.104 --> 00:02:27.474
No time for that now!

00:02:30.784 --> 00:02:31.944
Hey!

00:02:32.114 --> 00:02:34.204
Wake up!

00:02:36.354 --> 00:02:39.114
Nighttime memories.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.694
You okay?

00:02:47.034 --> 00:02:49.194
You didn't sleep much, did you?

00:02:49.264 --> 00:02:53.254
I was on a roll last night. I just...

00:02:55.934 --> 00:02:58.334
Don't push yourself too hard!

00:02:58.744 --> 00:03:06.274
Yeah. But it's the first time in so long that the
words are really flowing, so I'm okay.

00:03:06.544 --> 00:03:07.814
That's good.

00:03:09.114 --> 00:03:11.554
So, what's the story about?

00:03:11.784 --> 00:03:17.054
Well... you'll just have to wait and see!

00:03:17.124 --> 00:03:20.224
Oh, come on! Just tell me a little bit!

00:03:20.364 --> 00:03:23.794
But I still haven't decided on the ending...

00:03:25.134 --> 00:03:28.074
You're going to announce it
in homeroom anyway, right?

00:03:28.974 --> 00:03:32.304
Just tell me what you've got, then. Please?

00:03:33.344 --> 00:03:37.104
Okay... just the basic plot.

00:03:39.984 --> 00:03:43.254
An ordinary girl dreams of being
engulfed by flames,

00:03:43.254 --> 00:03:44.484
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
An ordinary girl dreams of being
engulfed by flames,

00:03:44.484 --> 00:03:44.824
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.754
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
and awakens in a dark prison cell.

00:03:46.754 --> 00:03:48.294
And awakens in a dark prison cell.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.494
There, she encounters a prisoner

00:03:50.494 --> 00:03:55.624
who was once hailed as a holy maiden,
but has now been branded a heretic.

00:03:56.264 --> 00:04:02.294
It's the medieval prison where
they've locked away Joan of Arc.

00:04:04.374 --> 00:04:10.574
When the young girl appears unexpectedly
before her, Joan calls her a servant of the Devil.

00:04:11.314 --> 00:04:13.784
The young girl is taken aback by this accusation,

00:04:13.784 --> 00:04:20.184
and the atmosphere becomes hostile in the
small cell where the two girls are imprisoned.

00:04:21.324 --> 00:04:27.354
Joan is set to be executed the following dawn,
and various visitors come to pay their respects.

00:04:28.064 --> 00:04:32.704
A kindly jailor woman, novice nuns who
were her ardent admirers,

00:04:32.704 --> 00:04:36.634
and the knight who fought alongside her.

00:04:37.574 --> 00:04:41.634
The young girl beseeches the
visitors to save her,

00:04:42.444 --> 00:04:47.904
but the visitors are convinced she is Joan.

00:04:48.684 --> 00:04:56.114
The young girl can see and hear the
real Joan, but the visitors can't.

00:04:57.694 --> 00:05:03.864
As the young girl encounters these visitors
and hears them speak of Joan,

00:05:04.064 --> 00:05:08.474
she begins to understand the Ioneliness
Joan harbors inside.

00:05:09.674 --> 00:05:15.044
Until now, Joan has been unable to show
anyone her true feelings.

00:05:15.614 --> 00:05:22.274
She bore all of her pain,
sadness and suffering alone.

00:05:23.054 --> 00:05:25.784
The more time she spends with
the pure-hearted young girl,

00:05:25.784 --> 00:05:28.784
the more Joan allows her heart to open.

00:05:29.954 --> 00:05:33.764
Previously overcome by
despair and disillusionment,

00:05:33.764 --> 00:05:39.424
Joan once again finds something to
cherish more than life itself.

00:05:40.674 --> 00:05:48.874
The message is to never give up hope. Cling to
your beliefs, and you can change anything.

00:05:49.514 --> 00:05:53.414
Don't fear the future, and don't give up hope...

00:05:55.654 --> 00:06:02.054
...that's the sort of story I was
hoping to write, anyway.

00:06:04.494 --> 00:06:08.824
If it's no good, I'll try to
think of something else...

00:06:09.534 --> 00:06:11.124
Absolutely not!

00:06:11.864 --> 00:06:14.534
That was really great, Michi!

00:06:17.174 --> 00:06:18.664
Miss Kozuki, you're awesome!

00:06:19.404 --> 00:06:20.774
I was so moved!

00:06:21.074 --> 00:06:22.514
It's incredible!

00:06:22.614 --> 00:06:24.414
What an awesome story!

00:06:24.414 --> 00:06:26.384
I can't wait to get started!

00:06:30.114 --> 00:06:33.554
All right everyone, take your seats!

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:44.704
It's a wonderful story, Miss Kozuki.

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:55.274
Right... we'll have Miss Kozuki
continue working on the script.

00:06:58.814 --> 00:07:02.014
The school festival is in just over a month.

00:07:02.554 --> 00:07:07.754
Shall we begin making preparations,

00:07:07.754 --> 00:07:12.284
assuming that we'll be going ahead
with Miss Kozuki's story?

00:07:12.394 --> 00:07:14.454
Agreed!

00:07:17.034 --> 00:07:23.464
In that case, we'll need to begin making
the costumes, sets, and props.

00:07:24.874 --> 00:07:30.774
Of course, we won't know the details
until the script is finished...

00:07:31.644 --> 00:07:33.114
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:33.544 --> 00:07:35.144
No need to apologize!

00:07:35.514 --> 00:07:36.914
We're really looking forward to it!

00:07:42.894 --> 00:07:48.384
We'll need to start by seeing what's
available and buying the basics.

00:07:48.794 --> 00:07:53.704
For now, we'll need
construction paper, poster board...

00:07:53.704 --> 00:07:54.964
That Ekaril!

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:58.904
What on earth is your ship's commander doing?

00:08:02.474 --> 00:08:08.144
She's studying Forime ecology.
It's a genuine investigation!

00:08:08.484 --> 00:08:12.314
Investigation? All I see her
doing is messing around!

00:08:12.724 --> 00:08:14.514
No one asked you, prisoner!

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:18.984
The commander has her own
reasons for what she's doing.

00:08:19.364 --> 00:08:21.724
It's not our place to question her!

00:08:22.634 --> 00:08:24.424
Her own reasons, hmm?

00:08:26.234 --> 00:08:28.704
Still no response from Azanael.

00:08:29.834 --> 00:08:32.674
Shall we issue a command?

00:08:32.904 --> 00:08:38.244
There's no need. I know I can count
her to carry out her duties.

00:08:38.344 --> 00:08:39.404
Right!

00:08:42.414 --> 00:08:45.014
That ship doesn't have much longer...

00:08:56.164 --> 00:08:57.764
Lady Hagino...

00:08:57.764 --> 00:08:59.754
...got up early and left?

00:08:59.934 --> 00:09:02.304
And she's alone with that girl?!

00:09:03.234 --> 00:09:08.044
They've gone to the next town to see what's
available and buy some materials...

00:09:10.644 --> 00:09:12.914
Senkoji
Kato
Kozuki
Wakatake

00:09:26.594 --> 00:09:30.464
No fair!

00:09:45.614 --> 00:09:47.344
Awesome!

00:09:48.654 --> 00:09:50.944
Would you close the window?

00:10:05.664 --> 00:10:09.234
Paper, fabric, and, let's see...

00:10:09.234 --> 00:10:10.404
Hey...

00:10:10.404 --> 00:10:11.504
Yes?

00:10:11.504 --> 00:10:14.804
That huge thing I saw at the harbor...

00:10:15.644 --> 00:10:16.974
What?

00:10:17.074 --> 00:10:20.074
That was your ship, wasn't it?

00:10:21.814 --> 00:10:24.984
Yes, it was. Why do you ask?

00:10:24.984 --> 00:10:28.824
Somehow, I felt like I'd seen it before.

00:10:29.854 --> 00:10:31.824
Oh? How strange.

00:10:34.194 --> 00:10:35.854
I wonder why.

00:10:37.734 --> 00:10:39.424
Would you like to come aboard?

00:10:40.534 --> 00:10:42.934
Your ship? Really?

00:10:43.804 --> 00:10:44.874
Yes.

00:10:44.874 --> 00:10:46.274
All right!

00:10:48.244 --> 00:10:50.834
You're not scared?

00:10:51.644 --> 00:10:52.774
Of what?

00:10:53.384 --> 00:10:55.904
Of us.

00:11:00.694 --> 00:11:05.714
To tell the truth, it's not just the ship.

00:11:07.964 --> 00:11:14.424
I felt like I'd known you since long ago, too.

00:11:34.454 --> 00:11:37.624
Amazing! It's like a festival or something!

00:11:38.924 --> 00:11:41.454
Quit staring. Let's go.

00:11:41.564 --> 00:11:44.554
Hey, wait up! Hey!

00:12:39.124 --> 00:12:41.784
I think that about does it.

00:12:42.454 --> 00:12:44.424
Whew, I'm beat!

00:12:45.224 --> 00:12:47.714
You didn't help at all!

00:12:47.864 --> 00:12:49.294
That's true!

00:12:50.394 --> 00:12:54.634
I know! Let's reward ourselves for
a successful shopping trip!

00:13:07.284 --> 00:13:08.944
Wow!

00:13:09.814 --> 00:13:14.654
What a view! It sure is different from
the town where school is.

00:13:14.894 --> 00:13:20.024
We're not that far away.
But this town has its own terminal...

00:13:21.634 --> 00:13:23.594
I guess the school's that way.

00:13:23.734 --> 00:13:25.704
Yes. You can't see it from here.

00:13:28.304 --> 00:13:29.634
Hey...

00:13:31.044 --> 00:13:34.444
What would you say to walking back?

00:13:36.044 --> 00:13:39.944
Walking? It would take about three hours.

00:13:40.984 --> 00:13:43.644
I guess we'd get back too late, huh?

00:13:44.684 --> 00:13:48.914
It's okay if we call the dorm. But why?

00:13:49.454 --> 00:13:54.554
I haven't been getting a lot of exercise lately.
I just feel like walking some more...

00:13:54.764 --> 00:13:55.894
Or something?

00:13:55.894 --> 00:13:56.994
All right.

00:13:59.134 --> 00:14:00.464
Really?

00:14:03.204 --> 00:14:08.434
I feel like walking a bit more myself.

00:14:13.944 --> 00:14:15.344
Hey, Blue!

00:14:15.454 --> 00:14:19.354
Is monitoring the commander part of
the official mission, too?

00:14:20.324 --> 00:14:22.384
The commander hasn't ordered it.

00:14:23.454 --> 00:14:28.264
This is... a self-initiated mission.

00:14:28.264 --> 00:14:31.704
A gunner spying on her commander
having a good time, huh?

00:14:32.234 --> 00:14:34.494
What kind of military procedure is that?!

00:14:35.004 --> 00:14:36.024
Shut up!

00:14:37.004 --> 00:14:39.874
Yes, I'll tell them. All right.

00:14:41.044 --> 00:14:45.814
That was Miss Senkoji. They're going to be
a little late, but she said not to worry.

00:14:47.614 --> 00:14:50.584
Another of Wakatake's harebrained ideas, I bet!

00:14:50.584 --> 00:14:54.024
There's no need to worry. Hagino's with her.

00:14:54.294 --> 00:14:55.654
That's true!

00:14:58.964 --> 00:15:04.264
At first, I couldn't believe
I had to go shopping with you.

00:15:04.564 --> 00:15:06.434
That goes for me, too.

00:15:06.434 --> 00:15:07.904
What?!

00:15:09.574 --> 00:15:11.664
But... it's strange...

00:15:12.474 --> 00:15:13.344
What is?

00:15:13.344 --> 00:15:17.304
I never thought we'd have
so much to talk about.

00:15:19.544 --> 00:15:21.574
That goes for me, too.

00:15:21.854 --> 00:15:23.714
Hey, that's not fair!

00:15:32.824 --> 00:15:34.194
For Pete's sake...

00:15:34.194 --> 00:15:36.524
She's certainly taking it easy.

00:15:36.894 --> 00:15:40.964
Perhaps the commander
is looking for something.

00:15:43.104 --> 00:15:45.144
What do you mean?

00:15:45.144 --> 00:15:47.434
I'm not sure myself.

00:15:47.874 --> 00:15:48.814
But...

00:15:48.814 --> 00:15:50.244
But?

00:15:50.244 --> 00:15:52.474
Before she met that Forime...

00:15:53.944 --> 00:15:57.644
She never used to laugh like that.

00:16:14.334 --> 00:16:15.434
What's wrong?

00:16:15.434 --> 00:16:17.664
Nothing!

00:16:18.474 --> 00:16:21.134
Geez, I'm starved!

00:16:34.154 --> 00:16:37.454
That Forime was involved in the accident?

00:16:38.464 --> 00:16:41.124
She seems to have some unusual abilities, too.

00:16:41.734 --> 00:16:43.784
Contact telepathy, huh?

00:16:46.734 --> 00:16:47.504
Kaio Academy 1999
Student Roster

00:16:47.504 --> 00:16:48.474
Kaio Academy 1999
Student Roster
No changes observed in
Mari Wakatake of late...

00:16:48.474 --> 00:16:50.974
No changes observed in
Mari Wakatake of late...

00:16:50.974 --> 00:16:52.374
Hagino Senkoji
No changes observed in
Mari Wakatake of late...

00:16:52.374 --> 00:16:53.104
Hagino Senkoji

00:16:58.544 --> 00:16:59.984
What's going on?

00:17:00.844 --> 00:17:02.904
There's special protection on this file?

00:17:05.884 --> 00:17:08.184
You've got broken blisters!

00:17:08.924 --> 00:17:11.354
I'm okay! Let's go!

00:17:18.634 --> 00:17:23.434
What should we do?
The buses aren't running anymore.

00:17:52.764 --> 00:17:54.494
It's really pouring!

00:17:56.134 --> 00:17:58.504
It doesn't look like it'll let up soon.

00:18:01.074 --> 00:18:02.414
What's wrong?

00:18:02.414 --> 00:18:03.634
My bag!

00:18:04.544 --> 00:18:06.534
We forgot it when we took off your shoes...

00:18:07.084 --> 00:18:09.984
We'll go get it when the rain lets up.

00:18:11.684 --> 00:18:12.844
It's all right.

00:18:13.184 --> 00:18:15.784
But the poster board and construction paper...

00:18:20.794 --> 00:18:22.454
I hope they're okay...

00:18:25.564 --> 00:18:27.194
It sure is coming down.

00:18:28.404 --> 00:18:30.564
Do your feet still hurt?

00:18:32.074 --> 00:18:36.474
Don't feel badly.
We can always buy more paper.

00:18:37.944 --> 00:18:39.914
I'm such a moron.

00:18:40.544 --> 00:18:43.014
I got carried away... and now...

00:19:05.004 --> 00:19:06.494
You'll catch cold.

00:19:23.054 --> 00:19:30.194
On our planet, there's only what
you call females here.

00:19:32.104 --> 00:19:34.724
For now, we can still survive,

00:19:35.634 --> 00:19:39.474
but unless we do something,
we're bound for extinction.

00:19:41.514 --> 00:19:43.604
That's why we came here.

00:19:53.684 --> 00:19:57.784
Does she realize what she's saying?

00:19:58.424 --> 00:20:02.524
Divulging Arume secrets...
what's she thinking?!

00:20:02.894 --> 00:20:08.164
I trust the commander. Onomil did, too.

00:20:09.334 --> 00:20:12.394
I don't expect you to trust her,

00:20:12.804 --> 00:20:15.774
but try to understand.

00:20:16.374 --> 00:20:21.114
You can't imagine how deeply the commander
blames herself for what happened...

00:20:34.764 --> 00:20:37.064
Changes in commander's
brain wave pattern detected.

00:20:37.734 --> 00:20:39.394
Contact telepathy!

00:20:42.274 --> 00:20:45.904
Internal pressure of the
Emil Force Drive is out of control!

00:20:46.474 --> 00:20:49.414
Commander! Answer me, please! Commander!

00:20:49.544 --> 00:20:51.914
How did this happen?

00:20:53.884 --> 00:20:55.114
How did...

00:20:55.114 --> 00:20:58.984
Commander! Commander!
Answer me please, Commander!

00:20:59.654 --> 00:21:01.744
The engines are going to give out!

00:21:13.234 --> 00:21:16.204
Commander! We can't control the
engine from the bridge!

00:21:16.674 --> 00:21:19.574
Onomil... Onomil's gone to the engine room!

00:21:20.644 --> 00:21:24.274
Onomil! You're in danger! Evacuate! Onomil!

00:22:21.674 --> 00:22:22.834
It was you?

00:22:25.074 --> 00:22:31.744
You were the one who saved me, weren't you?

00:22:40.484 --> 00:22:41.854
Thank you!

00:22:43.124 --> 00:22:45.594
Thank you, Hagino!

00:23:03.014 --> 00:23:06.244
She saved that Forime...

00:23:07.344 --> 00:23:13.344
...and abandoned Onomil?

00:23:29.004 --> 00:23:36.464
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:23:37.274 --> 00:23:47.324
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:23:47.324 --> 00:23:54.994
A gentle breeze blowing

00:23:55.694 --> 00:24:03.574
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:07.774
The passing time

00:24:07.774 --> 00:24:13.114
Quietly watches over you

00:24:13.314 --> 00:24:17.054
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:17.054 --> 00:24:22.544
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:23.894 --> 00:24:28.194
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:28.194 --> 00:24:33.034
Searching for answers in life

00:24:33.034 --> 00:24:37.334
Always believing in the day

00:24:37.334 --> 00:24:43.044
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:24:43.044 --> 00:24:47.004
In the blue dreams!

00:25:00.894 --> 00:25:03.224
The savior and the saved.

00:25:03.794 --> 00:25:11.934
Mari gives Hagino her complete trust, but
Hagino continues to be wracked with guilt.

00:25:12.174 --> 00:25:20.244
She invites Mari aboard Blue
to confess and apologize.

00:25:21.914 --> 00:25:26.984
Next time on Blue Drop: Cirsium
